title Home Assistant 0.3.0: touch on the stored dashboard: a row's name opens its entity page (the row's name override "Lamp"), back; a sensor card opens its page; the header toggle turns the card's lights and switch off
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash

# the keys bring the row into view on every screen, the tap hides the focus again
wait 1800
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
tap "Lamp"
wait 600
shot lamp-page
check lamp-page
expect text "Turn on"
key esc
wait 600
expect text "Living room"
# the sensor card three stops before the end (the Air card's header toggle, its fan, the battery row)
key end
key end
key up
key up
key up
wait 400
tap "Power"
wait 600
shot sensor-page
check sensor-page
expect text "12 W"
# the first card's header toggle: everything on it off
key esc
wait 600
key home
key home
key enter
wait 900
shot header-off
check header-off
expect noquit
